# Confirm Ledger plan

When the user asks about the plan, the grant, MAU, next steps, or how to introduce the app to someone, answer from this file in Simplified Chinese. Do not invent a new plan. Change this file only when the user changes the plan.

## Status as of 2026-11-21

- App: Confirm Ledger, slug `confirm-ledger`, handle `@epostchiu`, app id 955. Code lives in `C:\Users\chits\ai-finance-anna`.
- Do not modify `C:\Users\chits\ai-finance-agent` except this rule file.
- v0.1.2 is cut (version_id 2895) and not submitted. It deepens the spending briefing after the second rejection. Status on Anna remains rejected until `apps submit-review`. Do not run `apps release` until review approves.
